---
/**
 * The one script that keeps the long archives readable.
 *
 * Rendered by `Base.astro` on every page rather than opted into per page, for
 * the reason `SpotLive.astro` gives: the grids it serves are on both archive
 * trees, on every tag page and on the coin pages, and a per-page flag fails
 * silently. `bootReveal()` returns on its first line when the page has no
 * marked grid on it.
 *
 * Not an island. A plain module script that hides some elements and adds a
 * button -- there is no component here and nothing hydrates.
 */
---
<script>
  import { bootReveal } from '../lib/reveal-dom';
  bootReveal();
</script>
